{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"5e8f25120c1f8003","type":"text","text":"如何成为工作能力强的人","x":-125,"y":-30,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"6d4a90f04c81abe2","type":"text","text":"接到任务，先问标准","x":-124,"y":122,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"617007db7d82c112","type":"text","text":"和领导当面确认，希望任务达到什么标准","x":283,"y":122,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"e37b8ed9a75d686e","type":"text","text":"SMART原则","x":283,"y":260,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"0e52b51bd7f3c337","type":"text","text":"**S具体的**（不能是摸棱两可的或笼统概括的）","x":654,"y":94,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"0971df6c83009d86","type":"text","text":"**A可实现的**不能毫无挑战和不切实际，最好是==跳跃性目标==","x":660,"y":260,"width":250,"height":86},
		{"id":"4dc8984062e9504a","type":"text","text":"**R任务相关性的**要与大目标相关联，不能八竿子打不着","x":654,"y":360,"width":250,"height":80},
		{"id":"3ef23198bdbd9509","type":"text","text":"**T有时限的**目标必须具有明确的截止期限，以确保目标的及时性。","x":654,"y":460,"width":250,"height":80},
		{"id":"779510bf32cf7427","type":"text","text":"请示工作，必带方案","x":-123,"y":345,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"e49d6c2615c541ca","type":"text","text":"带着至少两个方案去给领导","x":-520,"y":352,"width":244,"height":60,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"f20d0220b4b5a3ee","type":"text","text":"**RISK：风险**风险演示，如果不这么做会有什么样的损失","x":-848,"y":180,"width":250,"height":100},
		{"id":"e9bd66301282528c","type":"text","text":"**Interest：利益**利益称述，如果这样做有什么好处","x":-860,"y":292,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"c1b5e0dd2b6179b0","type":"text","text":"**Differences：差异**点出这样做和其他方式有什么差异","x":-860,"y":382,"width":250,"height":90},
		{"id":"a275896bbaa47e78","type":"text","text":"**Effect：影响**强调影响，这样做也会有一些无关紧要的影响","x":-848,"y":500,"width":250,"height":80},
		{"id":"3ac1baecff2ac4dc","type":"text","text":"汇报工作，突出结果","x":-243,"y":554,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"0be63568d47f22c4","type":"text","text":"**PREP汇报模型**","x":213,"y":597,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"ce0ef6d7fb367c9f","type":"text","text":"**P:抛出结论**==清晰表达==你的==结论==，让别人知道你接下来围绕什么展开","x":628,"y":571,"width":250,"height":89},
		{"id":"2b64e726a5ebf226","type":"text","text":"**R：给出依据**通过==有效的数据==，==有力的事实==验证结论的可靠性","x":625,"y":693,"width":250,"height":87},
		{"id":"a03ac59c0d57ad89","type":"text","text":"**E：具体事例**列举简单==具体事例==加强听者对结论的理解","x":628,"y":820,"width":250,"height":87},
		{"id":"3aa837cc27005ba6","type":"text","text":"**P：重述结论**==重申一遍自己的结论==，可以总结和强调","x":625,"y":960,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"d81dcd86dd14596e","type":"text","text":"分享工作，细说流程","x":-308,"y":783,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"8144ab6157d9bfa3","type":"text","text":"**5W2H法则**","x":-766,"y":838,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"faa58a62396e8b4b","type":"text","text":"**Where**：使用场景在哪里？","x":-1210,"y":928,"width":270,"height":60,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"12f065fbdec59449","type":"text","text":"**Why**：预期目标是多少？","x":-1210,"y":808,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"f5b6256feffa6dc3","type":"text","text":"**Who**：目标人群是谁？","x":-1210,"y":680,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"ab1dfb466554004b","type":"text","text":"**What**：产品背景是什么？","x":-1210,"y":584,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"08c47af214c1d314","type":"text","text":"**When**：需求节点在何时？","x":-1210,"y":1040,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"56656a72cb30dac3","type":"text","text":"**How**：如何验证有效性？","x":-1210,"y":1220,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"c125b010d3f4479b","type":"text","text":"**GRAI复盘模型**:（生成SOP文档，分享给团队）","x":200,"y":1200,"width":240,"height":60,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"ea0c9184b09b2bae","type":"text","text":"**Goal（目标回顾）**：当初的行为意图或者目的是什么？事件/行为的目标或期望是什么？","x":626,"y":1121,"width":250,"height":109,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"2a4f0b9923c055b9","type":"text","text":"**Result（结果陈述）**：列出目标实际完成情况，做了哪些关键工作？将结果和目标对比，有哪些亮点和不足？","x":626,"y":1230,"width":250,"height":150,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"cf938c7ea5418744","type":"text","text":"**Analysis（过程分析）**：尽可能客观地描述执行过程，分析亮点产生的关键有哪些？导致不足根本性原因又是什么？","x":625,"y":1380,"width":250,"height":140,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"dc1a89e6e4eca4bf","type":"text","text":"**Insight（归类总结）**:通过分析找到解决不足之处的办法，总结可以解决类似事情的规律经验，形成方法论","x":625,"y":1520,"width":250,"height":140,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"f06cb403be2e9624","type":"text","text":"复盘工作，总结SOP","x":-183,"y":1116,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"63955e87377f957b","type":"text","text":"**M可衡量的**==指标设定可衡量，不能有争议==","x":660,"y":182,"width":250,"height":58},
		{"id":"01002cc3c2f41b35","type":"text","text":"**How much**用了多少资源？","x":-1210,"y":1320,"width":260,"height":60,"color":"3"}
	],
